{"unit_id": "tag:01SA:proof", "translation": "从右到左的函子（functor）由<MATH_0001>给出。\n由引理<REF_0001>以及 Constructions 一章中引理<REF_0002>的第（3）部分，这两个函子（functors）互逆（inverse）。\n最后一条陈述见 Constructions 一章中引理<REF_0003>的第（2）部分。\n", "allowed_english": ["Constructions"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "inverse", "target_term": "互逆"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "从右到左给出的范畴间映射。"}, {"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子", "context": "两个方向的函子。"}, {"source_term": "inverse", "target_term": "互逆", "context": "描述两个函子彼此为逆。"}], "notes": []}
